  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Support to the National Programme Planning and Development Process in the context of SDG and LNOB (CPD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The project aims to support the government of the Democratic Republic of S&#xe3;o Tom&#xe9; and Pr&#xed;ncipe, especially focusing on enhancing the capacity of key government departments and officials, such as the Planning Director of the Minister of Planning, Finance and the Blue Economy , the External Policy Directorate of Ministry of Foreign Afaairs as well as INE, specialized commissions of the Parliament and other audit and budget oversight Institutions. It seeks to facilitate strategic policy development</narrative>
  </description>
